    {
      "_id": "ZsBXqGQuhdeLT42o",
      "name": "精类步 Fey Step",
      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "source": {
          "custom": "",
          "book": "TCoE",
          "page": "112",
          "license": "",
          "rules": "2014",
          "revision": 1
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">妖精魔法地传送到最远 30尺的一处它可见的未被占据空间。然后根据所选精类情绪，触发以下效果之一：</span></p><ul style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:rgb(93, 20, 43) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin:0.5em 0px;padding:0px 0px 0px 1.5em;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(248, 244, 241);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium\"><li style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:rgb(93, 20, 43) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:rgb(93, 20, 43) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\">愤怒Fuming。</strong>在使用精类步后，妖精在它回合结束前的下一次攻击检定具有优势。</span></li><li style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:rgb(93, 20, 43) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:rgb(93, 20, 43) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\">欢欣Mirthful。</strong>在使用精类步后，妖精可以立即选择它 10 尺内可见的一个生物，强迫其进行一次对抗你的法术豁免 DC 的感知豁免，若豁免失败则其将被你及妖精生物魅惑，持续 1 分钟或目标受到任何伤害。</span></li><li style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:rgb(93, 20, 43) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:rgb(93, 20, 43) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\">诡诈Tricksy。</strong>在使用精类步后，妖精可以立即令魔法黑暗充斥于它 5 尺内的一个 5 尺立方区域，魔法黑暗持续直到妖精的下回合结束。</span></li></ul><p>The fey magically teleports up to 30 feet to an unoccupied space it can see. Then one of the following effects occurs, based on the fey's chosen mood:</p><ul class=\"rd__list rd__list-hang-notitle\"><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Fuming\"><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Fuming.</span> The fey has advantage on the next attack roll it makes before the end of this turn.</p></li><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Mirthful\"><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Mirthful.</span> The fey can force one creature it can see within 10 feet of it to make a Wisdom saving throw against your spell save DC. Unless the save succeeds, the target is &amp;Reference[condition=charmed] by you and the fey for 1 minute or until the target takes any damage.</p></li><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Tricksy\"><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Tricksy.</span> The fey can fill a 5-foot cube within 5 feet of it with magical darkness, which lasts until the end of its next turn.</p></li></ul></div>",
          "chat": ""
        },
